        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_GIANTROOM — in Giant Room&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are in the Giant Room.  The ceiling here is too high up for your&lt;br&gt;lamp to show it.  Cavernous passages lead east, north, and south.  On&lt;br&gt;the west wall is scrawled the inscription, &amp;quot;FEE FIE FOE FOO&amp;quot; [sic]." source_id="LOC_GIANTROOM" description_en="You are in the Giant Room.  The ceiling here is too high up for your&#10;lamp to show it.  Cavernous passages lead east, north, and south.  On&#10;the west wall is scrawled the inscription, &quot;FEE FIE FOE FOO&quot; [sic]." description_es="" short_en="You're in Giant Room." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_CENTRAL" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_GIANTROOM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" objects_here="EGGS" treasures_here="EGGS">
