        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_PITBRINK — at brink of pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are on the brink of a thirty foot pit with a massive orange column&lt;br&gt;down one wall.  You could climb down here but you could not get back&lt;br&gt;up.  The maze continues at this level." source_id="LOC_PITBRINK" description_en="You are on the brink of a thirty foot pit with a massive orange column&#10;down one wall.  You could climb down here but you could not get back&#10;up.  The maze continues at this level." description_es="" short_en="You're at brink of pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_MAZE_ALIKE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_PITBRINK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ALLALIKE=True, DEEP=True, NOBACK=True">
