        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_MISTY — in misty cavern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are following a wide path around the outer edge of a large cavern.&lt;br&gt;Far below, through a heavy white mist, strange splashing noises can be&lt;br&gt;heard.  The mist rises up through a fissure in the ceiling.  The pat&lt;br&gt;[... full description stored in node metadata ...]" source_id="LOC_MISTY" description_en="You are following a wide path around the outer edge of a large cavern.&#10;Far below, through a heavy white mist, strange splashing noises can be&#10;heard.  The mist rises up through a fissure in the ceiling.  The path&#10;exits to the south and west." description_es="" short_en="You're in misty cavern." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ORIENTAL_PLOVER" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_MISTY" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" sound="NO_MEANING">
