        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_CLIFFTOP — Just as you reach the top, your foot slips on a lo...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Just as you reach the top, your foot slips on a loose rock and you&lt;br&gt;make one last desperate grab.  Your luck holds, as does your grip.&lt;br&gt;With an enormous heave, you lift yourself to the ledge above." source_id="LOC_CLIFFTOP" description_en="Just as you reach the top, your foot slips on a loose rock and you&#10;make one last desperate grab.  Your luck holds, as does your grip.&#10;With an enormous heave, you lift yourself to the ledge above." description_es="" short_en="" maptag="" chapter_id="CH_RESERVOIR" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_CLIFFTOP" review_status="ok" role="transient" conditions="DEEP=True">
          <mxCell id="CH_RESERVOIR_LOC_CLIFFTOP" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
