        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_RESBOTTOM — at bottom of reservoir&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are walking across the bottom of the reservoir.  Walls of water&lt;br&gt;rear up on either side.  The roar of the water cascading past is&lt;br&gt;nearly deafening, and the mist is so thick you can barely see." source_id="LOC_RESBOTTOM" description_en="You are walking across the bottom of the reservoir.  Walls of water&#10;rear up on either side.  The roar of the water cascading past is&#10;nearly deafening, and the mist is so thick you can barely see." description_es="" short_en="You're at bottom of reservoir." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_RESERVOIR" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_RESBOTTOM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, FLUID=True" sound="TOTAL_ROAR" loud="true">
