        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_BARRENFRONT — in front of Barren Room&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are standing at the entrance to a large, barren room.  A notice&lt;br&gt;above the entrance reads:  &amp;quot;Caution!  Bear in room!&amp;quot;" source_id="LOC_BARRENFRONT" description_en="You are standing at the entrance to a large, barren room.  A notice&#10;above the entrance reads:  &quot;Caution!  Bear in room!&quot;" description_es="" short_en="You're in front of Barren Room." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_BARRENFRONT" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True">
