        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_BOULDERS2 — in Chamber of Boulders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are in a small chamber filled with large boulders.  The walls are&lt;br&gt;very warm, causing the air in the room to be almost stifling from the&lt;br&gt;heat.  The only exit is a crawl heading west, through which is coming&lt;br&gt;[... full description stored in node metadata ...]" source_id="LOC_BOULDERS2" description_en="You are in a small chamber filled with large boulders.  The walls are&#10;very warm, causing the air in the room to be almost stifling from the&#10;heat.  The only exit is a crawl heading west, through which is coming&#10;a low rumbling." description_es="" short_en="You're in Chamber of Boulders." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_BOULDERS2" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" objects_here="OBJ_63" treasures_here="OBJ_63" sound="DULL_RUMBLING">
