        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_FORK — at fork in path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The path forks here.  The left fork leads northeast.  A dull rumbling&lt;br&gt;seems to get louder in that direction.  The right fork leads southeast&lt;br&gt;down a gentle slope.  The main corridor enters from the west." source_id="LOC_FORK" description_en="The path forks here.  The left fork leads northeast.  A dull rumbling&#10;seems to get louder in that direction.  The right fork leads southeast&#10;down a gentle slope.  The main corridor enters from the west." description_es="" short_en="You're at fork in path." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_FORK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" sound="DULL_RUMBLING">
