        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SW — Repository sw end&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are at the southwest end of the repository.  To one side is a pit&lt;br&gt;full of fierce green snakes.  On the other side is a row of small&lt;br&gt;wicker cages, each of which contains a little sulking bird.  In one&lt;br&gt;corner&lt;br&gt;[... full description stored in node metadata ...]" source_id="LOC_SW" description_en="You are at the southwest end of the repository.  To one side is a pit&#10;full of fierce green snakes.  On the other side is a row of small&#10;wicker cages, each of which contains a little sulking bird.  In one&#10;corner is a bundle of black rods with rusty marks on their ends.  A&#10;large number of velvet pillows are scattered about on the floor.  A&#10;vast mirror stretches off to the northeast.  At your feet is a large&#10;steel grate, next to which is a sign that reads, &quot;Treasure Vault.&#10;Keys in main office.&quot;" description_es="" short_en="You're at sw end." maptag="Repository sw end" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SW" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, LIT=True" sound="SNAKES_HISSING">
          <mxCell id="CH_REPOSITORY_LOC_SW" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
