        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SWCHASM — on sw side of chasm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are on one side of a large, deep chasm.  A heavy white mist rising&lt;br&gt;up from below obscures all view of the far side.  A sw path leads away&lt;br&gt;from the chasm into a winding corridor." source_id="LOC_SWCHASM" description_en="You are on one side of a large, deep chasm.  A heavy white mist rising&#10;up from below obscures all view of the far side.  A sw path leads away&#10;from the chasm into a winding corridor." description_es="" short_en="You're on sw side of chasm." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SWCHASM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" objects_here="CHASM, TROLL" immovable_objects_here="CHASM, TROLL">
