        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_WARMWALLS — Warm junction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The walls are quite warm here.  From the north can be heard a steady&lt;br&gt;roar, so loud that the entire cave seems to be trembling.  Another&lt;br&gt;passage leads south, and a low crawl goes east." source_id="LOC_WARMWALLS" description_en="The walls are quite warm here.  From the north can be heard a steady&#10;roar, so loud that the entire cave seems to be trembling.  Another&#10;passage leads south, and a low crawl goes east." description_es="" short_en="You're at junction with warm walls." maptag="Warm junction" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_WARMWALLS" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" sound="LOUD_ROAR">
