        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_WINDOW1 — at window on pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&amp;#x27;re at a low window overlooking a huge pit, which extends up out of&lt;br&gt;sight.  A floor is indistinctly visible over 50 feet below.  Traces of&lt;br&gt;white mist cover the floor of the pit, becoming thicker to the right&lt;br&gt;[... full description stored in node metadata ...]" source_id="LOC_WINDOW1" description_en="You're at a low window overlooking a huge pit, which extends up out of&#10;sight.  A floor is indistinctly visible over 50 feet below.  Traces of&#10;white mist cover the floor of the pit, becoming thicker to the right.&#10;Marks in the dust around the window would seem to indicate that&#10;someone has been here recently.  Directly across the pit from you and&#10;25 feet away there is a similar window looking into a lighted room.  A&#10;shadowy figure can be seen there peering back at you." description_es="" short_en="You're at window on pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_Y2_WINDOWS" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_WINDOW1" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" objects_here="OBJ_27" immovable_objects_here="OBJ_27">
